/* Matches base-game pattern (cf. $christmas_robin_visit line 249 and $christmas_robin_gift_received line 2942):
     • Flat persistent flag $christmas_poppy_orphanage gates re-entry.
     • Date is implied by $christmas; we still spell out monthDay 25 for parity with sibling events.
     • _li is a local convenience for branching dialogue inside the scene. */
:: Poppy Christmas Orphanage
<<set $christmas_poppy_orphanage to 1>><<set _poppyChristmasLI to Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
<<npc Poppy>><<person1>><<generatey2>><<person2>>
You celebrate Christmas with the other residents. A <<person1>><<person>> passes a gift to another orphan. As <<he>> does, the door <b>slams</b> open, letting in a rush of cold air and snow.
<<person1>><span class="purple">It's Poppy!</span> 
<br><br>
<<He>> stands in the doorway, grinning despite the cold, snowflakes melting on a bright red Santa costume. There's a large container balanced in <<his>> arms.
<<He>> looks around the room, a warm glint in <<his>> eyes as <<he>> takes in the residents gathered in the main hall. 
<br><br>
<<He>> steps forward and calls out, "Hey, kiddos! Guess who brought cookies?"
<br><br>
Now that <<hes>> closer, you can see the container is filled with brightly decorated gingerbread men.
<br><br>
<<He>> takes it over to a table where the orphans gather around, eyes wide.
"Merry Christmas, everyone," <<he>> says with a smile.
<br><br>
The cookies vanish into eager hands.
<br><br>
<<person2>>"So sweet!" <<he>> exclaims through a mouthful of gingerbread.
<br><br>
<<person1>>Poppy approaches you with two cookies in hand.
<<if _poppyChristmasLI>>
	"For you, my jewel." <<He>> says with a wink and passes you one. It's a Santa hat, decorated with red and white icing.
	<br><br>
	"Sorry I took so long, I tried to get here sooner for you, but I ran into some... <i>difficulties</i> along the way." Poppy says sheepishly.
<<else>>
	<<He>> passes you one. It's shaped like a Santa hat, decorated with red and white icing.
	<br><br>
	"Sorry I took so long. I meant to wake up earlier," Poppy says sheepishly.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Eat your cookie|Poppy Christmas Cookie]]>><</link>>

:: Poppy Christmas Cookie
<<effects>>
You and Poppy eat the gingerbread cookies. You catch a glimpse of Poppy's cookie. It has orange and white icing, though you can't figure out what it is once <<he>> takes a bite.
<br><br>
<<link [[Compliment <<him>>|Poppy Christmas Compliment]]>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
<br>
<<link [[Insult the baking|Poppy Christmas Insult]]>><<npcincr Poppy love -4>><<npcincr Poppy patience -5>><</link>><<llove>><<llpatience>>

:: Poppy Christmas Compliment
<<effects>>
"It tastes great," you say.
<br><br>
Poppy breaks out into a smile. "Thank you!" <<he>> says with joy.
<br><br>
<<poppyChristmasBaileyPayment>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Poppy Christmas After Answer]]>><</link>>

:: Poppy Christmas Insult
<<effects>><<person1>>
"You need to work on your baking," you remark. "It doesn't taste as good as it looks."
<br><br>
Poppy doesn't say anything, but <<his>> glaring eyes speaks volume.
<br><br>
<<poppyChristmasBaileyPayment>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Poppy Christmas After Answer]]>><</link>>

:: Poppy Christmas After Answer
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<set _poppyChristmasLI to Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
Poppy heads back to you. 
<br><br>
"The orphans look so happy, don't they? I didn't see this very often before..."
<<if _poppyChristmasLI>>
	<<He>> trails off, appearing lost in thought for a moment. 
	<br><br>
	Poppy snaps out of <<his>> thoughts and looks back at you. "Hey, I have one more gift that I'd like to show you back at my flat. Would you like to come with me?" 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Accept (0:10)|Poppy Christmas Flat Accept]]>>
		<<set $christmas_poppy_flat_pending to 1>>
		<<set $christmas_poppy_route to "accept">>
		<<if window.markPoppyInteraction>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><</if>>
		<<pass 10>>
	<</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Decline|Poppy Christmas Flat Decline]]>>
		<<set $christmas_poppy_flat_pending to 1>>
		<<set $christmas_poppy_route to "decline">>
		<<if window.markPoppyInteraction>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> trails off. "Well, now that that's done with, I think it'd be best if I head out too." 
	<br><br>
	<<He>> says over <<his>> shoulder as <<he>> leaves. You wave to <<him>>. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<if window.markPoppyInteraction>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><</if>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Poppy Christmas Flat Accept
<<location "barb">><<effects>>
