:: Poppy Christmas Flat Arrival
<<effects>><<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">>
<<npc Poppy>><<person1>>
<<if $christmas_poppy_route is "accept">>
	Poppy opens the door and leads you inside before shutting it. 
	<br><br>
	"Well, I only slipped twice as we came. Thanks for catching me love." <<He>> says with a bit of embarrassment. 
	<br><br>
	"Now, why don't you wait here and I'll change into something a bit more comfortable," <<he>> says as <<he>> heads towards the bedroom. 
	<br><br>
	You wait a little while for Poppy to change, when <<he>> sings out from the bedroom. "Why don't you join me in here, my jewel?"
<<else>>
	You enter Poppy's flat. 
	<br><br>
	"Hello?" you call out.
	<br><br>
	"In here, my jewel!" Poppy responds, <<his>> voice coming from the bedroom.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<poppyicon "bed">><<link [[Enter the bedroom|Poppy Christmas Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Flats]]>>
	<<npcincr Poppy love -3>><<npcincr Poppy patience -5>>
	<<set $christmas_poppy_flat_done to 1>>
	<<if window.markPoppyInteraction>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><</if>>
	<<endevent>>
<</link>><<llove>><<llpatience>>

