:: Poppy Comfort Talk
<<poppyComfortHeader>>
<<set _comfortBadEnd to poppyBadEndComfortAvailable()>>
<<if !_comfortBadEnd>>
	You start to say something about where you've been, then realise you've already said it.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Poppy Comfort Return]]>><</link>>
	<<exit>>
<</if>>

<<set _comfortDays to poppyBadEndComfortDays(_comfortBadEnd)>>
<<set _comfortLow to (T.poppyStatus and T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience"))>>
<<if _comfortLow>>
	Poppy still will not look at you. <<He>> has barely spoken since you came back, and you know why.
	You were gone for days without warning, so from <<his>> point of view, you simply stopped showing up.
	<br><br>
	You say <<his>> name, but <<he>> keeps looking away. "I wasn't in town," you explain. "I couldn't come."
	<br><br>
	Poppy finally turns towards you.
<<else>>
	Poppy notices you before you have decided how to begin. <<He>> watches you quietly, waiting for you to speak.
	<br><br>
	"I haven't been avoiding you," you say. "I wasn't in town, so I couldn't come."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> puts down what <<he>> was holding and looks at you properly.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $poppyComfortVenue is "lake">>
	"Sit," <<he>> says, moving along the bank to make room beside <<him>>.
<<else>>
	"Sit," <<he>> says, moving along the couch to make room beside <<him>>.
<</if>>
<<if _comfortDays gte 14>>
	"You've been gone for <<print _comfortDays>> days. I stopped counting, and then I started again. I want to know what happened."
<<elseif _comfortDays gte 7>>
	"You've been gone over a week. <<print _comfortDays>> days. I want to know what happened."
<<else>>
	"You've been gone for <<print _comfortDays>> days. I want to know what happened."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Tell Poppy all of it|Poppy Comfort Talk 2]]>><<set $phase to "open">><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Give Poppy the short version|Poppy Comfort Talk 2]]>><<set $phase to "short">><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask why <<he>> never came looking|Poppy Comfort Talk 2]]>><<set $phase to "lash">><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Poppy Comfort Talk 2
<<poppyComfortHeader>>
<<set _comfortSource to ($badEndStats.last() ? $badEndStats.last().source : "")>>
<<if $phase is "open">>
	You tell Poppy what happened, starting from when you were taken.
	<br><br>
	<<switch _comfortSource>>
		<<case "Underground Farm" "Underground Dungeon" "Mines">>
			You tell <<him>> about being kept underground, where you could not see the sky or tell how much time had passed.
			After a while, you stopped trying to count the days.
		<<case "Asylum">>
			You tell <<him>> about the ward, the locked doors, and the schedule you were forced to follow.
			You explain how long you were kept there before anyone finally allowed you to leave.
		<<case "Wolf Cave" "Eden">>
			You tell <<him>> about being kept deep in the forest, far from any road or nearby house.
			After enough time passed without seeing anyone, you stopped expecting someone to find you.
		<<case "Kylar Abduction">>
			You tell <<him>> about the room you were kept in, who put you there,
			and how everything had already been prepared before you arrived.
		<<case "Water Dragon Lab">>
			You tell <<him>> about the lab, what they did to you there,
			and the things that happened which you still do not fully understand.
		<<case "Prison" "Pound">>
			You tell <<him>> about being locked up and having no control over how long you would be kept there.
		<<default>>
			You tell <<him>> where you were held, what happened while you were there, and how you eventually escaped.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy")>>
		You speak quietly, stopping several times when the words become difficult.
		Poppy waits each time until you are ready to continue.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "docile">>
		You apologise twice while explaining what happened. Each time, Poppy shakes <<his>> head and lets you continue.
	<<elseif ($speech_attitude is "polite" or $speech_attitude is "flamboyant")>>
		You begin carefully, trying to explain everything without showing how much it affected you.
		That becomes harder as you continue, and before long you stop trying to hide it.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "confident">>
		You explain everything in order, keeping your voice steady even when your hands begin to shake.
	<<elseif ($speech_attitude is "bratty" or $speech_attitude is "cruel")>>
		You make a few jokes while telling <<him>>, trying to keep the worst parts from sounding serious.
		Poppy does not laugh, and eventually you stop joking.
	<<else>>
		You tell <<him>> everything in the order it happened.
	<</if>>
	After you finish, Poppy stays quiet while <<he>> takes in everything you have told <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	"I thought you didn't want to see me any more. I was angry with you for disappearing."
	<<He>> looks down before continuing. "I wish that had been the reason."
	<<stress -10>><<lllstress>><<trauma -10>><<llltrauma>>
<<elseif $phase is "short">>
	You tell <<him>> where you were, roughly how long you were gone, and how you managed to get away.
	You leave out what happened while you were there, but Poppy notices that you are avoiding that part.
	<br><br>
	<<if ($speech_attitude is "bratty" or $speech_attitude is "cruel")>>
		"That's all you're getting," you say, making it clear that you do not want any more questions.
	<<else>>
		"That's most of it," you say. "I don't want to talk about the rest yet."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Poppy stays quiet for a while, looking at you as <<he>> thinks over what you have told <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	"Alright," <<he>> says. "You don't have to tell me the rest today. I thought you'd stopped wanting to see me,
	so I've been angry with you for disappearing."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> looks down before continuing. "I'd rather find out I was wrong about that than know you stayed away
	because something bad happened to you."
	<<stress -6>><<llstress>><<trauma -4>><<ltrauma>>
<<else>>
	<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy")>>
		"You didn't come," you say before you can stop yourself. "Nobody came. You didn't even look for me."
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "docile">>
		"I kept thinking someone would come," you say quietly. "I thought it might be you."
	<<elseif ($speech_attitude is "bratty" or $speech_attitude is "cruel")>>
		"All that time, you were sitting here angry with me," you say. "Did you ever think about looking for me?"
	<<else>>
		"Why didn't you come looking for me?" you ask. "I waited for someone. I waited for a long time."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Your voice comes out sharper than you intended, but you leave the words as they are.
	Poppy does not argue or make an excuse. <<He>> looks down, taking a few seconds before answering.
	<br><br>
	"You're right... I thought you'd got tired of me and left. I was angry about it,
	and I never stopped to think that something might have happened to you."
	<<He>> looks back at you. "I should have looked for you. I'm sorry."
	<<stress -6>><<llstress>><<trauma -6>><<lltrauma>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $awarelevel gte 5>>
	<<His>> ears flatten against <<his>> head as <<he>> looks at you.
<<else>>
	<<He>> looks away while <<he>> speaks, only glancing back when <<he>> finishes.
<</if>>
<<if $poppyComfortVenue is "lake">>
	The water moves quietly in front of you while neither of you speaks.
<<else>>
	The flat is quiet except for the occasional sound from the pipes behind you.
<</if>>
<br><br>
After a short pause, <<he>> opens <<his>> arms slightly, leaving the choice to you if you want a hug.
<br><br>
<<link [[Let Poppy hold you|Poppy Comfort Talk 3]]>><<set $phase to "hold">><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask <<him>> to just sit with you|Poppy Comfort Talk 3]]>><<set $phase to "sit">><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Say you're fine|Poppy Comfort Talk 3]]>><<set $phase to "fine">><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Poppy Comfort Talk 3
<<poppyComfortHeader>>
<<set _poppyPatienceBefore to (Number(C.npc.Poppy.patience) || 0)>>
<<run poppyBadEndComfortResolve()>>
<<set _poppyPatienceGain to ((Number(C.npc.Poppy.patience) || 0) - _poppyPatienceBefore)>>
<<if $phase is "hold">>
	You move into <<his>> arms, and <<he>> pulls you close.
	<br><br>
	<<if $poppyComfortVenue is "lake">>
		<<He>> keeps one arm around you while you rest against <<his>> side.
	<<else>>
		<<He>> shifts closer on the couch, keeping you pressed against <<him>>.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> stays like that until you finally begin to relax, making no move to let you go.
	<br><br>
	You did not realise how tense you still were until your body started to relax in <<his>> arms.
	<<stress -8>><<llstress>><<trauma -8>><<lltrauma>><<tiredness -3>><<lltiredness>>
	<<if T.poppyLoveGainAllowed>><<npcincr Poppy love 3>><<glove>><</if>>
<<elseif $phase is "sit">>
	"Not yet," you say. "Just stay here."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> lowers <<his>> arms and sits beside you, leaving a small space between you.
	<<He>> stays close without trying to touch you.
	<br><br>
	You remain there together without speaking.
	<<if $poppyComfortVenue is "lake">>
		Ducks swim slowly along the far side of the lake while you watch them.
	<<else>>
		Sunlight shifts across the wall as the time passes.
	<</if>>
	For the first time since you came back, nobody is asking anything from you. You can sit quietly because you want to.
	<<stress -6>><<llstress>><<trauma -4>><<ltrauma>><<tiredness -1>><<ltiredness>>
	<<if T.poppyLoveGainAllowed>><<npcincr Poppy love 2>><<glove>><</if>>
<<else>>
	"I'm fine," you say. "It's over. I don't want to keep talking about it."
	<br><br>
	Poppy lowers <<his>> arms and studies you for a few seconds, but <<he>> does not push.
	<br><br>
	"Alright," <<he>> says. "If it starts bothering you later, you can come to me. I'll be here."
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<<if T.poppyLoveGainAllowed>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $phase is "fine">>
	As you get ready to leave, <<he>> reaches out and takes your hand.
<<else>>
	After a while, <<he>> sits back beside you and takes your hand.
<</if>>
"Next time you're late, I won't think you've lost interest in me. I'll think something happened to you.
That's our deal, my jewel."
<br><br>
<<He>> keeps hold of your hand until you agree.
<<if _poppyPatienceGain gte 20>><<gggpatience>><<elseif _poppyPatienceGain gte 10>><<ggpatience>><<elseif _poppyPatienceGain gt 0>><<gpatience>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Poppy Comfort Return]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Poppy Comfort Return
<<poppyComfortHeader>>
<<if !$poppySeen.includes("bad_end_comfort")>>
	<<set $poppySeen.push("bad_end_comfort")>>
	<br><br>
	<span class="green">Poppy will no longer lose patience with you while you are being held somewhere against your will.</span>
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<unset $phase>>
<<if $poppyComfortVenue is "lake">>
	<<unset $poppyComfortVenue>>
	<<poppyLakeReturn>>
<<else>>
	<<unset $poppyComfortVenue>>
	<<set $eventskip to 1>>
	<<poppyFlatsMenu>>
<</if>>
